{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09178","headline":"送雷监赴阙庭 · 韦应物","name":"送雷监赴阙庭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才大无不备，出入爲时须。\n雄藩精理行，秘府擢文儒。\n诏书忽已至，焉得久踟躅。\n方舟趂朝谒，观者盈路衢。\n广筵列衆宾，送爵无停迂。\n攀饯诚怆恨，贺荣且欢娱。\n长陪柏梁宴，日向丹墀趋。\n时方重右职，蹉跎独海隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}